{"ID":"20240118145014-5xw11l6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145014-5xw11l6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145014-5xw11l6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145014-i1nv7bc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161807-355blk0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161807-355blk0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:135,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:135\u0026#125;","title":"320雷丸","type":"doc","updated":"20240204144732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145014-i1nv7bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145014-i1nv7bc","updated":"20240122161750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名雷矢。味苦，寒，有小毒。主杀三虫，逐毒气，胃中热，利丈夫，不利女子。作膏摩，除小儿百病。生山谷土中。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161755-u89ea1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161755-u89ea1x"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国河南陕西湖北等地，生土中，为竹之余气所结，故亦曰竹苓。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161757-3rev2ji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161757-3rev2ji"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦（或作咸），性寒，有小毒（或作无毒）。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161758-2yeoomr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161758-2yeoomr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】雷丸为消积杀虫要药，主除皮中热结，逐毒气，杀诸虫，作摩膏治小儿百病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161801-jijhf24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161801-jijhf24"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】作摩膏除小儿百病，逐邪气恶风汗出，除皮中热结，积虫毒，白虫寸白，自出不止，久服令人阴痿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161803-3qafm8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161803-3qafm8t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】逐风，主痫狂走。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161805-j5ahgmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161805-j5ahgmq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161806-oef0apq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161806-oef0apq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】不利女子，多服令人阴痿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161751-ovf2qsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161751-ovf2qsk"}},{"ID":"20240122161806-eq7pzyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161806-eq7pzyb"}},{"ID":"20240122161807-uhr0tuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161807-uhr0tuy"}},{"ID":"20240122161807-355blk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161807-355blk0","updated":"20240204144732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那，这里没有雷丸哦，因为雷丸是很普遍的药，药房就有这个雷丸。320雷丸，这个雷丸中药房都有得卖。雷丸，一般来说，小儿科的时候使用，小孩子，儿科，一般来说雷丸可以做膏，做成药膏，涂在身体、皮肤上面。那你看雷丸的性味，味苦、咸，性寒有小毒，一般来说就是小孩子杀虫，像那个那个食物消化不好，用雷丸，杀虫，使用最多的就是蛔虫，现在这个雷丸呢，我手边没有。"}]}]}